 🚗 Smart Driver Booking & Drowsiness Detection System

 📌 Overview

A Django-based intelligent transport management system that allows users to book drivers online while integrating AI-powered drowsiness detection for driver safety monitoring.

The system ensures secure driver booking, payment handling, feedback management, and real-time driver fatigue detection to improve road safety.

---

 🚀 Problem Solved

Traditional driver hiring systems lack:

* Real-time safety monitoring
* Efficient online booking workflow
* Driver approval verification
* User feedback transparency

This system solves these issues through smart booking automation + AI-based drowsiness detection.

---

 🧠 AI / ML Model Used

* Computer Vision-Based Drowsiness Detection
* Real-time webcam monitoring
* Driver fatigue detection using facial/eye movement analysis

---

 📊 Core Detection Features

* Detects driver eye closure
* Monitors fatigue patterns
* Real-time alert triggering
* Background thread execution for live monitoring

---

