---

 ✨ Features

 👤 User Module

* Register/Login
* View approved drivers
* Book drivers instantly
* Online payment simulation
* Cancel bookings
* Submit ratings & feedback
* Track booking status

---

 🚘 Driver Module

* Registration with admin approval
* Manage booking requests
* Approve customer bookings
* Set trip charges
* View feedback & ratings
* Start drowsiness detection

---

 🛠️ Admin Module

* Approve/Reject drivers
* Manage users
* Monitor booking activities
* System control dashboard

---

 💳 Payment System

* Secure payment simulation
* Booking confirmation after payment
* Automatic status update

---

 ⭐ Feedback & Rating System

Users can:

* Rate drivers
* Submit trip feedback
* Improve driver quality assurance

---

 👁️ Drowsiness Detection Workflow

1. Start live camera monitoring
2. Detect facial landmarks
3. Analyze eye closure ratio
4. Detect fatigue state
5. Trigger alert instantly

---

 🔐 Security Features

* Session-based authentication
* Role-based access control
* Duplicate registration prevention
* Driver approval verification

